          "type": "text",
          "text": "A 180 km journey is completed in three stages with no stops. The second stage is twice as long as the first stage. The vehicle travels at 60 km/h in the first stage, 45 km/h in the second stage and 72 km/h in the final stage. Its average speed for the whole journey is 56.25 km/h. Find the length of the first stage in kilometres."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 5,
      "primary_outcome": "4.1",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
