            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Let the first-stage distance be x km, express the other two distances in terms of x, and use average speed to find the total time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "stage": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The three times are x/60, 2x/45 and (180 - 3x)/72 hours; their sum equals 180/56.25."
            }
          ]
        }
